      "source": "Abstract base class for entities. Allows parameterization of id type, chooses auto-generation and implements\n<a href=\"#equals(java.lang.Object)\"><code>equals(Object)</code></a> and <a href=\"#hashCode()\"><code>hashCode()</code></a> based on that id.",
